{"applicability_conditions":"适用于 Fe-Mn-C-Al 钢（FeeMneCeAl steel）中的奥氏体；用于热机械加工过程中 C、Mn、Al 原子向奥氏体分配后奥氏体晶格常数的描述。其中 C 以间隙固溶形式存在，Al、Mn 以置换固溶形式存在。","identity":{"block_id":"b0027","equation_id":"equation_002","equation_number":"2","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\alpha = 0. 3 5 7 2 1 + 0. 0 0 0 2 7 7 1 \\omega (\\mathrm{Al}) + 0. 0 0 4 4 0 8 9 \\omega (\\mathrm{C}) \\\\ \\quad + 0. 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 \\omega (\\mathrm{Mn}) \\end{array}\\tag{2}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.jmrt.2023.06.037"},"latex":"\\alpha = 0.35721 + 0.0002771\\,\\omega(\\mathrm{Al}) + 0.0044089\\,\\omega(\\mathrm{C}) + 0.0001166\\,\\omega(\\mathrm{Mn})","purpose":"计算奥氏体（fcc）的晶格常数 α，其随溶入奥氏体中的 C、Mn、Al 原子质量分数的变化而变化。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"奥氏体的晶格常数","symbol":"\\alpha","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Al 元素的质量分数","symbol":"\\omega(\\mathrm{Al})","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"C 元素的质量分数","symbol":"\\omega(\\mathrm{C})","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Mn 元素的质量分数","symbol":"\\omega(\\mathrm{Mn})","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"常数项系数（论文未单独解释）","symbol":"0.35721","unit":null,"value":"0.35721"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"\\omega(Al) 项的系数（论文未单独解释）","symbol":"0.0002771","unit":null,"value":"0.0002771"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"\\omega(C) 项的系数（论文未单独解释）","symbol":"0.0044089","unit":null,"value":"0.0044089"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"\\omega(Mn) 项的系数（论文未单独解释）","symbol":"0.0001166","unit":null,"value":"0.0001166"}],"unmapped":["该公式引自文献 [23,24]。","文中指出 C 原子对奥氏体晶格常数的膨胀作用远大于 Mn 和 Al 原子，因为 C 以间隙固溶形式存在而 Al、Mn 以置换固溶形式存在。"]}